invalidProcessEnvImport.js:5:20 lint/nursery/noDynamicDelete ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  i Avoid using delete with an environment variable name that is computed at runtime.
  
    4 │ const name = "FOO";
  > 5 │ delete process.env[name];
      │                    ^^^^
    6 │ 
  
  i Removing environment variables by a changing name makes it hard to tell which variables get removed.
  
  i Delete each environment variable by its name instead, for example delete process.env.API_KEY.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

